@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - 005 Teacher-Selected Writeback Answer

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Question Board\n+ Answer Adoption Panel" as Board
participant "Writeback Route" as API
participant "enqueue-writeback.lua" as Queue
database "Private Redis" as Redis
participant "Sheets Writeback Worker" as Worker
participant "update-writeback-status.lua" as Status
participant "Activity SSE + Projection" as Sync
participant "Student A" as StudentA
participant "Student B" as StudentB

== Question closes ==
Sync -> StudentA : results.finalized (only A's own submission, no winner)
Sync -> StudentB : results.finalized (only B's own submission, no winner)
StudentA -> StudentA : 你們的答案 + 等待老師公布正確答案

== Teacher adopts B's answer ==
Teacher -> Board : Select B (fastest A preselected), press 回填所選答案
Board -> API : POST writeback { requestId, selection: { source: group, groupId: B } }
API -> API : validate body (group id or answers[])
API -> Queue : enqueue(selectionJSON)
Queue -> Redis : round closed? B submitted?
alt latest job pending with a different selection
  Queue --> API : WRITEBACK_IN_PROGRESS
  API --> Board : 409 回填處理中
else same selection and job pending / succeeded
  Queue --> API : existing job
  API --> Board : 202 existing (no new write)
else new or changed selection (or failed)
  Queue -> Redis : HSET job adopted*, selectionKey, previousAnswers,\nrevision+1, status=queued; XADD writeback:jobs
  Queue -> Redis : XADD writeback.status queued { adopted }
  Queue --> API : { jobId, status: queued, adopted }
  API --> Board : 202
end

Worker -> Redis : read job
Worker -> Worker : prepare targets (cell may hold previousAnswers)
Worker -> Worker : RAW write + verify
Worker -> Status : succeeded
Status -> Redis : HSET round published* from job
Status -> Redis : XADD writeback.status succeeded { published }
Sync -> Board : writeback.status (已回填：B 的答案)
Sync -> StudentA : answer.published { source: group, groupId: B, answers }
Sync -> StudentB : answer.published { source: group, groupId: B, answers }
StudentA -> StudentA : 你們的答案 + 正確答案（老師採用）B

== Teacher re-selects a typed answer ==
Teacher -> Board : 自行輸入正確答案, press 重新回填
Board -> API : POST writeback { selection: { source: teacher, answers[] } }
API -> Queue : enqueue (selection differs, last job succeeded)
Queue -> Redis : requeue same job id, revision 2
Worker -> Status : succeeded
Sync -> StudentA : answer.published { source: teacher, groupId: null } (老師提供)

== Reload ==
StudentB -> Sync : GET events (snapshot)
Sync -> StudentB : rounds[] with own submission + publishedAnswer only
@enduml
